+config WASM_HOSTNET
+	bool "Host stream relay"
+	depends on INET
+	default y
+	help
+	  Lets the host open a stream to a port a program listens on. A
+	  kernel thread connects a socket to that port over loopback and
+	  copies bytes to and from the host, so the program accepts an
+	  ordinary connection.
+
